+# Changelog
+
+All notable changes to this project will be documented in this file.
+
+The format is based on [Keep a Changelog](https://keepachangelog.com/en/1.1.0/).
+
+## [Unreleased]
+
+### Added
+- Target Finance/Settlement ingest: `app/finance/` module polls `GET /sellers/v1/sellers/{seller_id}/payouts_search`, normalizes Stripe-format payout records (`po_*`, `txn_*`, `card_*`) into Postgres `payouts` table (STORY-012)
+- `TargetFinanceClient` — read-only async HTTP client for Target payout API with DI support
+- `ingest_once()` — daily poll cycle with upsert dedup on `Payout.id`, `status_known` flag for undocumented statuses, `NUMERIC(12,2)` precision for financial amounts
+- `PollState` — high-water-mark table for poll-based ingest (shared across future poll stories)
+- `get_target_credentials()` — single enforcement point for Target API credential loading from env vars (`TARGET_API_KEY` / `TARGET_PROD_API_KEY`)
+- B-tree indexes on `balance_transaction`, `destination_account`, `created_date`, `seller_id` for cross-reference queries
